      'uses rectification converting ac to dc protecting circuits against reverse polarity clamping voltage spikes freewheeling across relay coils and inductors demodulating radio signals special types zener diode deliberately used in reverse breakdown as a voltage reference schottky diode fast low drop led emits light photodiode detects light a plain diode does not emit light that is an led',
